{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39678","headline":"送二友游湘中 · 黄滔","name":"送二友游湘中","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"千里楚江新雨晴，同征肯恨迹如萍。\n孤舟泊处联诗句，八月中旬宿洞庭。\n爲客早悲烟草绿，移家晚失岳峯青。\n今来无计相从去，归日汀洲乞画屏。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"黄滔","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_39678.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39678","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}